      "side": 1,
      "message": "I looked at ctn730\u0027s init(), I couldn\u0027t understand why it relies on IRQ, it simply send command to ctn730 via I2C, do I miss anything? \n\nAnother thought is we can enable/disable IRQ in device driver instead of PCHG driver, so device driver can decides when the IRQ should be enabled/disabled.",
